Muffin!

[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_28_desc]
“Hooray, Derpy Hooves, in skies so blue,”\n“We raise our voices, our praises true,”\n“You bring us laughter, love, and light,”\n“Our saintly guardian through day and night.”

[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_28_TOOLTIP]
Citizens of Cloudsdale is thinking about Saint Derpy Hooves, but what exactly they are thinking about, Derpy will never know.

